+    - `showReminderNotification(raceName: String, sessionType: String)`
+  - `SessionAlarmScheduler(context: Context)`:
+    - `fun scheduleAlarm(sessionId: String, raceName: String, sessionType: String, triggerTimeMillis: Long)`
